Asagidaki kodun ne yaptigini ve time complexity'sini aciklayin:

def mystery(nums, k):
    heap = nums[:k]
    heapq.heapify(heap)
    for num in nums[k:]:
        if num > heap[0]:
            heapq.heapreplace(heap, num)
    return heap[0]
